---
layout: layout.njk
title: Health Education
description: Health education topics and teaching materials.
category: Health Education
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">🩺</div>

    <h1>Health Education</h1>

    <p class="cat-desc">
        Health education topics, teaching materials, charts, and awareness
        content for community health nursing practicals and assignments.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">

{% set posts = collections.healthEducation | reverse %}

{% for post in posts %}

    <div class="post-card">

        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>

            <p class="post-meta">
                {{ post.date }}
            </p>
        </div>

        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">
            View Topic
        </a>

    </div>

{% endfor %}

</div>
